### Flags of the index.

## The commands: what the palette and the command line call each, and what it does.

index-flags = Index flags
index-flags-description = The index entries marked intent-to-add, skip-worktree or assume-unchanged (the first 5000), and how many there are of each
index-set-flag = Set index flag
index-set-flag-description = Set or clear a flag on index entries; params: paths, flag (intent_to_add|skip_worktree|assume_unchanged), on (bool; intent_to_add cannot be cleared: unstage the file)
